# Standard exclusions
*.md
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
Dockerfile
CODE_OF_CONDUCT*
CONTRIBUTING*
LICENSE*
SECURITY*

# Node exclusions
build
dist
node_modules

# Local-only env files (public/config.js IS shipped; docker-entrypoint.sh rewrites it at start)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# App-specific exclusions (the E2E suite is not part of the image)
coverage
e2e
output
test-results
playwright-report
